# graphify corpus scope: source + docs only.
#
# Tests are excluded so the map and query results are not dominated by
# scaffolding. The cost of that choice: `graphify affected` will never list the
# tests that exercise a symbol — a blast-radius check must grep the test files
# separately, because the graph cannot answer "what tests this".
